{"id":"n38193-1-9","stage":1,"title":"기차역 · 火车站","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38193-1-9-1","ko":"저 오늘 기차 타고 집에 내려가요.","zh":"我今天要坐火车回家。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기차","meaning":"火车，列车","explanation":"기차：火车，列车","readings":[{"term":"기차","audio":"/audio/d0ab4116e9831f86ef6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60632","senseId":"1","lemma":"기차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타고","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려가요.","meaning":"下，下去","explanation":"내려가다：下，下去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"내려가다","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63723","senseId":"9","lemma":"내려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"d0ab4116e9831f86","term":"기차","zh":"火车，列车","audio":"/audio/d0ab4116e9831f86ef6e.mp3","entryId":"60632","definition":"运载人或东西、依靠燃料产生的动力行驶在铁轨上的长型车子。","pronunciation":["기차"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"d27a99abb5cf233c","term":"내려가다","zh":"下，下去","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3","entryId":"63723","definition":"从某个高处移动到低处。","pronunciation":["내려가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6e8a84d36066660c156a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38193-1-9-2","ko":"그럼 내가 기차역으로 마중 나갈게.","zh":"那我就去火车站接你。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기차역으로","meaning":"火车站","explanation":"기차역：火车站；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"기차역","audio":"/audio/f45f007ed4804de2e14b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38193","senseId":"1","lemma":"기차역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마중","meaning":"接站，接机","explanation":"마중：接站，接机","readings":[{"term":"마중","audio":"/audio/810477f1a03c9c2cdb26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54342","senseId":"1","lemma":"마중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나갈게.","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}]